Fusion PDF is an independent, unofficial graphical front-end. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by the qpdf project.

At run time, Fusion PDF calls the qpdf command-line program, which is NOT
included in this repository or in its releases and must be installed
separately (for instance: winget install QPDF.QPDF).
